            {
                "comment": "Prof. Min's lectures are interesting and active, he always use simple examples and story to explain hard concept, and try to make the lecture funny, and highly participatory. Course materials are not very easy, but Prof. Min makes them understandable, you can actually learn real-life knowledge and practical applications in his lectures.",
